    {
      "name": "yoko_execute_approved_operation",
      "title": "本人が確認した操作を実行",
      "description": "架空データ専用。本人が画面APIで内容を確認した下書きと、同じoperation_id・再送キー・種別・全内容に限定したmobility:execute委任が必須。最長300秒。AIのconfirmedフラグは不可。依頼・予約・変更・取消を保存し、席数・監査・通知台帳も同じCoreで一括処理。再送は必ず同じ内容・ID。期限/失効/料金/資格/版/空席の変化は拒否。実課金や実通知はない。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "operation": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "operation_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,100}$"
              },
              "idempotency_key": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,100}$"
              },
              "kind": {
                "enum": [
                  "request",
                  "book",
                  "change",
                  "cancel"
                ]
              },
              "payload": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "draft_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,100}$"
                  },
                  "details": {
                    "type": "object"
                  }
